{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18mini_level_act18mini_st03","groupId":"act18mini","stageId":null,"title":"错身","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18mini/level_act18mini_st03.txt","sourceHash":"3a397b95251416b15b0f5ed32a9077633cbaa9fe8e0f47142c81e9a6e6a17485","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"城墙之战后，萨卡兹的败退在城内引发了新的混乱。诺威尔与自救军领袖克洛维希娅合作救下了无辜的人，他目睹了自救军领袖的死亡，也坦然地放下了自己的执着。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g1_lentiavenue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥利，跟紧我......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不愿让我抱着，就必须得自己牢牢地跟紧了。抓住我的衣服，知道吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈没办法牵着你的手......我手上全是汗水，会滑开的！所以，你一定要抓紧我的衣服。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（点头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柯林，柯林！你在哪儿？咱们到底还能出去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实在不行，我们还是先躲回家里去吧！孩子这样小，要怎么跟着我们逃命呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柯林——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快来，我找到一条路！典范军进城后，看守咱们的那些魔族佬也都被引开了，只要不撞上爆炸——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“只要不撞上爆炸”！杂货店的施瓦尔背着家当跑出来，只是在发红光的地方摔了一跤......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伤口不过巴掌大，却把身上的血都流干了，你忘啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，是被“抽”干了......那样的东西真的还是爆炸吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那都是因为他的伤口一直没愈合！只要咱们小心些，别受伤，也别流血，就不会有问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，现在绝不能往回走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才炸开的地方离我们这儿不超过两百米，比起莫名其妙死在半路上，我宁可回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柯林，你祖母还在城里呢——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......往回走只会更危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没人能确定封锁区里的萨卡兹是不是全都被调离了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你从外面进来，是典范军？你们是来帮我们的吗？求求你，救救我们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我不是典范军，我和他们没有关系，也不为救人而来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来伦蒂尼姆，只为了找一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找谁？你的鞋子都磨破了，可到现在的伦蒂尼姆来，还能找到谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是典范军，你只是个和我们一样的可怜人。柯林，我们往回走吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人重重地叹息，再次谨慎地打量四周。\n时隔多年，他再次作为配镜师来到伦蒂尼姆。这座城市如今的样貌，就像在工坊的热气中举起镜片查验，画面模糊而失真。\n等到终于看清，映入眼帘的仅剩动荡。要在这样的混乱中准确找到一个行踪诡谲、不知面貌的存在并非易事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您想要什么？我把我身上所有值钱的东西都给您，能不能求您带我们出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您独自进了封锁区却毫发无伤，这代表您一定知道安全的路。我请求您......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"瘦小的男子低头将身上口袋摸遍，又从包裹里掏出几块面包，试图塞到诺威尔手里。一旁的女性也连忙从身上掏出零碎的钱币来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"诺威尔没有伸手去接。他摇了摇头，知道眼前三人的未来与路边流干了血的尸体仅有一线之隔。\n自己站在那条纤细的隔断之后，从来都如此旁观。\n他曾经伸出过双手，可仅靠这一双手，无法挽救所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柯林，我们走吧，他不会答应的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没有其他的办法了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......虽然我不是典范军，但我知道他们驻扎在哪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以带你们去典范军的据点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！谢谢、谢谢您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仅此而已，我也不能做更多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好，已经足够好了，我们都跟您走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柯林，那你祖母呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等这些事情都结束，我们会回来接她的。魔族佬再怎么残忍，也不至于对疗养院里手无寸铁的老人下手——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我带你们出去，至于之后如何......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就只能靠你们自己了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，这足够了。谢谢您，好心的先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不用。牵好孩子，跟在我身后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这边走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g3_fogblockadestreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就从这里继续往前，一直走到城墙下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城墙下有处被轰炸出来的空洞，典范军的一部分人正驻扎在那周围。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再往外，应该是公爵联军的队伍。你们也可以自己选择去向谁求助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您呢，您去哪儿？听您的意思，是不会继续同我们一起走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在刚才救了我们的命。虽然我不明白是怎样做到的，但至少让我们也为您做些什么吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。伤口已经愈合了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算——就算您再天赋异禀，那些炮火对您也不会比对我们更加仁慈。要我说，您就应该和我们一起走......您也是维多利亚人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。我只是......我只是已经来到了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须找到那个人，没有停下的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说了好几次找人，您究竟在找谁呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这不是她第一次问出这个问题。但这是一路以来第一次，她听见眼前男人的回答有了平静以外的声调。\n他身上许多对常人来说足以致死的伤口都已开始愈合。流血很快止息，连萨卡兹的法阵也影响不了这具身体。\n只有疼痛始终存在。即使如此，他仍用力攥紧了拳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在找......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给予我这个“天赋”的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g1_lentiavenue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"先生......先生！我们现在应该怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"往这边走。我掩护你们，尽量赶在下一波炮击之前撤离——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让——让开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老子今天一定得从这鬼地方出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都别挡道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请回到后面去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在应该保障孩子与老人优先撤离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在放什么屁——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自救军的疏散路线是最安全的，如果你坚持独自离开......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......请问你是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？我是伦蒂尼姆自救军的领袖，你可以叫我克洛维希娅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说了这片区域里有人在组织市民撤离，感谢你提供的帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，自救军会接手撤离行动。你的使命结束了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我依然可以帮忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这很危险，我们不能平白要求你以身涉险交换他人的生路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自救军无法许诺你任何回报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们甚至没有太多时间谈论......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长话短说，就当作我受到了某种诅咒吧，不必顾及我的安全。让我来掩护你们，能帮助更多的人撤离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正我也需要在这里，继续寻找那个人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g4_fogblockadestreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后一支小队也已经过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个自救军领袖......克洛维希娅呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"诺威尔四下张望，终于决定抓住一个工人模样的男子，即使他只是从自己身前匆匆路过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，请问——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我没注意到你另一只手上有伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以帮你治疗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。有什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问你有没有见到自救军的领袖，克洛维希娅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也带着几支被疏散的市民队伍，先前兵分两路之后，我们约定在这里会合。然后我就没再见到她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"带来的人倒是早就分开安置了，至于她本人，不出意外应该还在组织最后的撤离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我也不能肯定，毕竟大家都有自己的要紧事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她早就到了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你们的撤离路线不仅更安全，也更快捷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是更了解属于地下的那部分伦蒂尼姆，这并不代表绝对的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛维希娅需要亲自指挥，以协助市民躲开残余萨卡兹佣兵的袭击，你要是不怕魔族佬的陷阱，兴许回封锁区能找到她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你也带出了不少人，应该帮得上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——先生！好心的先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您瞧见奥利了吗？就是我那个红头发的、不爱说话的孩子，才到我膝盖这么高，您瞧见了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的孩子，他不见了......他走失了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥利——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死！他到底跑去哪儿了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他一直在说你的祖母，柯林，兴许......兴许他也放心不下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这附近都找过了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的、是的，都找过了！一起过来的大伙儿也都在帮忙找人，可再往前，没找过的地方就剩下封锁区了，这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"封锁区对我来说和其他地方没有差别，我可以去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛维希娅——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉她我已经把人安全带到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你一起去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你们留在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，我是说克洛维希娅回来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看，她怀里还抱着一个红头发的孩子——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——什么？在哪里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"众人抬头，想要顺着那人所指的方向望去——\n变故就是在这时发生的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——所有人都后退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是奥利！她抱着奥利！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要过去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"诺威尔只来得及伸手拽住失控的女人。\n目之所及，异常的红光闪烁，地表塌陷如血口翕张，吞没了自救军的领袖。\n无数目光抛向眼前大地震颤着的中心。直至最后一刻，震中的人都紧紧地搂着怀中的孩童。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"与往常无二的烟尘逐渐散去，似乎也象征万事万物又短暂归于寂静。\n此地之人已经历无数这样的别离，它的结果从不因罹难者的身份而有任何改变。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g4_fogblockadestreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳咳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，先不要过去——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"二次爆炸，或仅是余震，曾在相似的情况下反复上演。诺威尔知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......奥利......！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们去组织搜救！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先、先生，是您！您还在这儿！求您，求您帮帮奥利——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不怕那些魔族佬的陷阱，您恢复得很快，又很勇敢，那您是不是至少可以、可以将他带回来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他还，那么小......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"诺威尔其人，一生少有能够完全控制的东西，漫长的生命带来汪洋一般的记忆，但他也无法做到随意采撷。\n就像普通人年老时一般，他也常常因为情景的重叠而陷入恍惚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g4_swamp_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就到这里吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"送到这里就可以了吗？您真的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......不继续留下来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他还，那么小......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我最小的孩子，他甚至还不会叫您祖父。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经太久了，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本应更早就追随你的母亲而去，却等到现在，等到你的面庞变得比我这个父亲更加苍老。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一事无成，我总是留恋，我已经踌躇太久，久到对孩子们而言，我已全然陌生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只有一个办法可以结束这注定成为局外人的命运......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那现在就是使用它的时刻了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g4_fogblockadestreet_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"诺威尔望向爆炸和塌陷发生的位置。恍惚中，土石砖块组成的空洞陡然变为百年前的某处昏黑沼泽。\n也是在这样一个清晨，耳边响起近似的挽留或哀求。那时他固执地选择了拒绝，然后踏上了注定失败的尝试死亡的道路，而这次......\n他不会做出同样的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......克洛维希娅掉下去之前，护住了那孩子的头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这意味着，或许奥利可以活下来。但在得到确认之前，这只是一种可能，所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我会下去，找到他们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"诺威尔按照自救军的指引，试图从地下进入废墟，又倚仗体质和常年漫游获得的经验持续前进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"向西，三百米左右......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g17_wunderpass"},{"type":"narration","text":"他步履不停，轻巧而迅速地走着，直到眼前出现有别于之前的景象。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在异族法阵启动后的痕迹周围，由塌陷形成的石堆旁，一个红发的孩子安静地躺着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（轻柔的呼吸声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他快步向前，将孩子抱起来搂在怀中，他能感觉到孩子小小的胸腔随着呼吸的频率起伏。\n如果不是头发上那些灰烬和碎石，这孩子看上去甚至安稳得仿佛还睡在柔软床铺之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没有严重外伤，应该只是昏迷。被独自留在这里，但不是直接坠落......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"赶上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"甚至克洛维希娅可能也在附近，她把奥利放下了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"克洛维希娅！你在前面吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"能听见的话，就敲击你身边坚硬物体的表面——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"克洛维希娅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你能......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"几步之后，他直面了真相。\n半身被深埋于石块之中的自救军领袖已经失去意识。\n年轻领袖的双眼以一种自然而轻柔的方式闭合。她将永远安眠于这地底？\n数秒前坠落时的痛苦瞬间，最后留下的竟然只有平静。这令诺威尔不禁思索——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“如果我能够死去，到那时，我会否拥有同样的神情？”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"克洛维希娅！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_5"},{"type":"narration","text":"因余震落下的碎石，仿佛雨后羽兽骤然抖落一身潮湿的水点，急促，分散，令人猝不及防。\n诺威尔甚至没来得及上前确认克洛维希娅是否仍有呼吸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"narration","text":"为保护年幼的孩子，他在剧烈的震颤中果断弯折背脊，用身体挡下了坠落的土石。其中尖锐的那些轻易刺破衣物与皮肤，陷进骨肉。\n但他丝毫未动，咬牙等待余震止息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"narration","text":"这声呜咽将他从剧痛的恍惚中惊醒。\n昏迷的孩子，醒来后发现自己身处昏暗而陌生的地界，走投无路而哭，最为原始的本能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，奥利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......没关系，没关系。我在这里......我是诺威尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们先前见过，你记得吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"余震似乎停下了。诺威尔单手抱着奥利，用另一只手慢慢支撑自己，强行抬高压在背后的重量，跪坐起来。\n所幸那只是碎裂的石块，并非完整沉重的石板。但血腥气仍然随着动作弥散开来，怀中的孩子只能在昏暗里无措地摇头。\n孩子几乎什么也看不见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......克洛维希娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她救了你......我必须先把你安全带出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......然后我再回来......把她带出去。她不该安息在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"诺威尔跪坐着，将不住颤抖的男孩放到地上，准备自己拔出插在背上的碎片。\n男孩伸手揪住了诺威尔的衣服。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不是要抛下你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，我不会因为这个死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有什么能杀死我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"说到这里，男人甚至微笑起来。话语间，他的手已经摸到了插在肩胛之间的最后一枚碎片。\n诺威尔咬牙将其拔下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......吓到你了，奥利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别担心，来吧。无论如何，我会带你出去的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"忍耐疼痛早已成为深入骨髓的习惯，诺威尔再度抱起男孩，准备循着记忆中过来的方向，找到能供两人安全撤离的出路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_5"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"过来的路......是这个方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"坚持一下，奥利。我会带你出去，你父母就在外面等着——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（挣扎）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想下去？但我抱着你会更快，也更安全。你难道不想早点见到你的母亲吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（跳下去）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......行，那你跟紧我，不要放手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"孩子点头，伸出手拽住了诺威尔的衣角。他甚至无师自通地将那片衣角在自己小小的手掌中绞紧一圈，表示自己准确听见了大人的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那我们就——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你走过了很漫长的路......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......可怜的人......"},{"type":"narration","text":"突然，空灵的话语，带着回音，自残壁四方传来。\n在昏暗中，轻纱一般的雾气逐渐弥散，直至将诺威尔包围。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你为何来此？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这声音，诺威尔永远不会认错。\n男人发觉自己无法动弹。陡然升起的、冰冷的愤怒，不断冲击着他的神智，使他停在了原地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想要什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他不知道这个声音出现在此时此刻是何用意，本能的不信任凌驾于一切判断之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停止装神弄鬼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我以为你一直想见到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你究竟在说什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是谁？你在哪儿？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就在此处。你为我而来，我也为你而来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你只需要......睁开眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"此前，诺威尔从未得见这声音的主人，也无法从旁确证它的样貌。长久以来，他只能反复拼凑那些传言，将疑问咀嚼成怨恨。\n如果这声音是真实而非虚幻，那它一定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？那么，你一定能告诉我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我该称呼你为有求必应的仙子，还是伟大万能的护国公？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这隐藏在历史背面的独角兽，既是仙灵，也是恶徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“独角兽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那些都是我，也都不是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“独角兽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在此，只为向你，一个可怜的人，许诺一个补偿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至不知道我的名字。我的遭遇，对你这样传奇的存在——对你曾经搅弄的那些风云而言，一定不值一提。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“独角兽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你说的话并不准确。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“独角兽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你身上原本有我期待的可能。一株不辨品类的小草，如果永远都不会枯萎，它会长成何种模样，它又将如何影响四野？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“独角兽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这就是我赐予你长生时所想的。这本应是一个祝福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，“祝福”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你傲慢的“祝福”只给我带来了漫长的痛苦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“独角兽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......这并非我的本意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可它的确变成了凌迟！而且与现实不同，你甚至不让我真正死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它只是——诅咒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“独角兽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我理解你的愤怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“独角兽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我，我该怎么做才会令你好受些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又要向我施舍你的另一个祝福了吗？"},{"type":"narration","text":"诺威尔感受到孩子抓住自己衣角的力道又大了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥利......你能听到吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（点头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那是欺诈者的声音，不要去听，也不要去想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我送你离开，奥利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你是谁，找那些随你起舞的传说英雄问去吧，我要离开这里了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“独角兽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"掌舵者始终只是时代浪潮中的少数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在抱怨？向我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“独角兽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......既然你已将我的祝福认作诅咒，那我可以对此做出补偿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“独角兽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"许下愿望吧。你想要什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"只是一个名字，诺威尔想。只是一个名字。这该死的、因身负伟力而永远高高在上的恶徒，已经完全遗忘了野草的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“独角兽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你还有机会......你已经比常人得到更多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"看着我，她一定充满怜悯——\n“可怜的、微不足道的人啊，我会帮助你，我永远都会帮助你。”\n“让我们将过往的悲惨都用未来的美好一笔勾销。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“独角兽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想好了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，奥利。我们已经耽搁太久了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“独角兽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（抓紧诺威尔的衣服）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，孩子。我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是害怕那个声音......其实不必理会。如果真的是它，那也只是一个犯罪者，和那些在城里作乱的人没有任何区别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会回来抓住它。但现在，我得先把你带出去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“独角兽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——是小奥利！诺威尔先生找到他了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快点，快过来帮忙！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小心，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我托着你，你先爬上去。慢一点——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没事，先生，上边有我接着呢，别担心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"来，诺威尔先生，接下来是您。您受伤了吗？需不需要帮把手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"诺威尔利落地翻身上去，停在地下入口的边缘，并未立刻走向不远处的人群。\n他再次注视那为浓云所掩盖的日头。这依然是他看过的无数个日出的其中之一，却因日光之下劫后余生的人们而有了些许不同。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g3_fogblockadestreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥利！哦，天，我的宝贝——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你吓坏我了！下次、下次我一定得紧紧抱着你......不能再有这样的事发生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这衣裳上的血是怎么来的？你哪里受伤了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，没找到哪里受伤了呀......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（看了看诺威尔）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥利，那个最开始找到你的姐姐在哪儿？她是不是还在......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不在下面？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你这孩子......总之，平安回来就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诺威尔先生，谢谢您——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"诺威尔看见朝自己挥手的男人脸上露出了焦急与慌乱之外的表情。\n那是感激的笑容，带着令人感到局促的诚挚，因此他只能点头，然后回以微笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用......谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"但男人脚步不停，依旧向他走来，站定之后又伸出手，像是仅靠语言无以表达自己的感谢。于是诺威尔保持着笑脸，下意识地回握了。\n直到这时，他终于迟钝地感觉到逐步扩散的疼痛，从后背，到胸前，直至全身。他因为呼吸困难而攥紧衣领，不得不弯下腰去。\n先前被碎石刺破的伤口，仍未开始愈合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃，先生，您怎么了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天哪，您的背后！我不知道您受了这样重的伤——得赶紧找医生清创包扎——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我真是糊涂了，您自己就是医生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我受伤了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......您背上这伤口还在流血啊？这么大、这么多创口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伤口还没有开始愈合？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的、是的。这对我们是稀松平常，但对您来说，一定很奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在下面遇到什么了，怎么受了这么重的伤？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，那位自救军的领袖，似乎也还在废墟里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也保护了奥利，或许我得向自救军表个态，比如下去，将她的尸体带回来......之类的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛维希娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她叫克洛维希娅？好像是这个名字。真可惜，我甚至没能仔细地瞧见她是什么模样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说她是个伟大的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我是伦蒂尼姆自救军的领袖，你可以叫我克洛维希娅。\n“那些都是我，也都不是我。”\n自救军无法许诺你任何回报。\n“我在此，只为向你，一个可怜的人，许诺一个补偿。”\n我们甚至没有太多时间谈论......\n“告诉我，我该怎么做才会令你好受些？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伟大的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"克洛维希娅......原来他刚刚错过了他穷尽一辈子去试图寻找的人。\n可这已经不重要，不再重要了。诺威尔在被疼痛和呼吸剥夺意识的间隙，努力抬起头来。\n模糊的视线尽头，一个孩子紧紧地抓住母亲的手。那孩子瞧上去健康极了，暖色的头发与皮肤，脸上带笑，简直就像......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，先生，我扶您去找自救军或者典范军！他们那里一定有军医......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说什么？为什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"简直就像是太阳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诺威尔先生！您——您怎么了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坚持住——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"诺威尔再也没有支撑自己的力气，跪了下去，委顿在地。跋涉百年的疲倦像是在这一刻全数归返自身。\n在失血使手脚都冰凉之前，他无视脊背上伤口狰狞的疼痛，将自己用力蜷缩起来，直至头顶触及地面。\n他几乎摆出了一个可以被标记为虔诚的姿势，却并不为了向任何人祈求或祷告。\n半晌，他抬起头来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自救军的领袖，不在废墟里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"疼痛依然，悲哭的冲动依旧。可四周万籁俱寂，只有一颗心脏的跳动，正在胸腔中隆隆作响。\n那个令他感到幸福、令他能够死去的东西......已经在这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛维希娅不在那里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的伤——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，比起做无用功......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺威尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我应该抓紧时间，救下更多人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
